claim.claim-text:
providing a handheld digital device (10) to the user, the handheld digital device including a display (16) and a camera (18);
presenting an optokinetic stimulus (S13) to the user on the display (16) of the handheld digital device (10);
capturing moving images of eye movement (S14) of the user while the user views the optokinetic stimulus (S13);
varying the optokinetic stimulus (S13) while monitoring the eye (26) movements of the user;
determining a working distance (22) between the display (16) and eyes (26) of the user;
saving at least the working distance (22) measured to memory, reporting out the working distance (22) measured on the display (16) or both;
making a record of parameters of the optokinetic stimulus (S13) that is presented on the display (16) of the handheld digital device (10); and
transmitting the working distance (22) and the parameters of the optokinetic stimulus to a health care practitioner.

a display (16);
a camera (18);
a processor (12); and
a memory (14);
wherein the processor (12) is in operable communication with the display (16), the camera (18) and the memory (14) and further comprises an image capture engine (36) and an image analysis engine (38);
the processor (12) being programmed to present an optokinetic stimulus (S13) on the display (16) of the handheld digital device (10);
the image capture engine (36) being programmed to execute the following:

monitoring eye movement of a user while the user views the optokinetic stimulus (S 13);
varying the optokinetic stimulus (S13) while monitoring the eye movements of the user;
measuring a working distance (22) between the display (16) and eyes (26) of the user;
saving at least the working distance (22) measured to memory (14), reporting out the working distance (14) measured on the display (16) or both;
making a record of parameters of the optokinetic stimulus on the display (16) of the handheld digital device (10); and
transmitting the working distance (22) and the parameters of the optokinetic stimulus (S13) to a health care practitioner.
